@startuml
title 高影响研究语义的 current / proposed 生命周期
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Inspect stable contract and evidence;
:Propose creates proposal.md,
tasks.md and contract-patch.yaml;
note right
  Stable specs and ledgers
  remain unchanged.
end note
:Human reviews exact current/proposed values,
evidence, risk and write plan;
if (Decision?) then (accept)
  :Revalidate target, current value
  and evidence;
  :Apply stable spec;
  :Write apply receipt and registry evidence;
  :Update patch lifecycle;
  :Append Decision ledger last;
elseif (reject)
  :Resolve lifecycle without applying;
  :Append rejection Decision;
else (postpone)
  :Append non-terminal Decision event;
  :Keep item pending;
endif
if (Resolved with trusted evidence?) then (yes)
  :Archive change or draft patch;
else (no)
  :Remain visible for review;
endif
stop
@enduml
